# Data (runtime/ephemeral) — NEVER track anything under data/.
# All of it is regenerated by the bot every run. Tracking these multi-MB,
# constantly-rewritten files churned git's object store until auto-gc died on a
# full disk and left 68GB of tmp_pack garbage (2026-05-31), and earlier made the
# branch unpushable (2026-05-29). The whole directory is ignored on purpose; the
# durable record lives in the Obsidian vault (projects/polymarket-bot/), not git.
data/

